{"nodes": [{"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_md", "label": "graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "page", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L1", "display_label": "Note:graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports", "text": ""}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_graphify_reference_extra_exports_and_benchmark", "label": "graphify reference: extra exports and benchmark", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L1", "display_label": "Heading:graphify reference: extra exports and benchmark", "heading_level": 1, "text": "# graphify reference: extra exports and benchmark\n\nLoad this when the user passed one of the export flags (`--wiki`, `--neo4j`, `--neo4j-push`, `--falkordb`, `--falkordb-push`, `--svg`, `--graphml`, `--mcp`), or when the corpus is large enough for the token-reduction benchmark. Each step runs only for its own flag."}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_step_6b_wiki_only_if_wiki_flag", "label": "Step 6b - Wiki (only if --wiki flag)", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L5", "display_label": "Heading:Step 6b - Wiki (only if --wiki flag)", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Step 6b - Wiki (only if --wiki flag)\n\n**Only run this step if `--wiki` was explicitly given in the original command.**\n\nRun this before Step 9 (cleanup) so `.graphify_labels.json` is still available.\n\n```bash\ngraphify export wiki\n```"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_step_7_neo4j_export_only_if_neo4j_or_neo4j_push_flag", "label": "Step 7 - Neo4j export (only if --neo4j or --neo4j-push flag)", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L15", "display_label": "Heading:Step 7 - Neo4j export (only if --neo4j or --neo4j-push flag)", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Step 7 - Neo4j export (only if --neo4j or --neo4j-push flag)\n\n**If `--neo4j`** - generate a Cypher file for manual import:\n\n```bash\ngraphify export neo4j\n```\n\n**If `--neo4j-push <uri>`** - push directly to a running Neo4j instance. Ask the user for credentials if not provided:\n\n```bash\ngraphify export neo4j --push bolt://localhost:7687 --user neo4j --password PASSWORD\n```\n\nDefault URI is `bolt://localhost:7687`, default user is `neo4j`. Uses MERGE - safe to re-run without creating duplicates."}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_step_7a_falkordb_export_only_if_falkordb_or_falkordb_push_flag", "label": "Step 7a - FalkorDB export (only if --falkordb or --falkordb-push flag)", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L31", "display_label": "Heading:Step 7a - FalkorDB export (only if --falkordb or --falkordb-push flag)", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Step 7a - FalkorDB export (only if --falkordb or --falkordb-push flag)\n\n**If `--falkordb`** - generate a Cypher file. The statements are OpenCypher, but FalkorDB's `GRAPH.QUERY` runs one statement at a time (no bulk script import like Neo4j's `cypher-shell`), so prefer `--falkordb-push` to load a graph. Use this only when you want the portable `cypher.txt` artifact:\n\n```bash\ngraphify export falkordb\n```\n\n**If `--falkordb-push <uri>`** - push directly to a running FalkorDB instance. Credentials are optional; ask the user only if the instance requires auth:\n\n```bash\ngraphify export falkordb --push falkordb://localhost:6379\n```\n\nDefault URI is `falkordb://localhost:6379` (the scheme is informational - `redis://` or a bare `host:port` work too), auth is optional, and the target graph defaults to `graphify`. Uses MERGE - safe to re-run without creating duplicates."}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_step_7b_svg_export_only_if_svg_flag", "label": "Step 7b - SVG export (only if --svg flag)", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L47", "display_label": "Heading:Step 7b - SVG export (only if --svg flag)", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Step 7b - SVG export (only if --svg flag)\n\n```bash\ngraphify export svg\n```"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_step_7c_graphml_export_only_if_graphml_flag", "label": "Step 7c - GraphML export (only if --graphml flag)", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L53", "display_label": "Heading:Step 7c - GraphML export (only if --graphml flag)", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Step 7c - GraphML export (only if --graphml flag)\n\n```bash\ngraphify export graphml\n```"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_step_7d_mcp_server_only_if_mcp_flag", "label": "Step 7d - MCP server (only if --mcp flag)", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L59", "display_label": "Heading:Step 7d - MCP server (only if --mcp flag)", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Step 7d - MCP server (only if --mcp flag)\n\n```bash\n$(cat graphify-out/.graphify_python) -m graphify.serve graphify-out/graph.json\n```\n\nThis starts a stdio MCP server that exposes tools: `query_graph`, `get_node`, `get_neighbors`, `get_community`, `god_nodes`, `graph_stats`, `shortest_path`. Add to Claude Desktop or any MCP-compatible agent orchestrator so other agents can query the graph live.\n\nTo configure in Claude Desktop, add to `claude_desktop_config.json`. Claude Desktop can't run `$(...)`, and under `uv tool install` the system `python3` can't import graphify \u2014 so set `command` to the **absolute interpreter path** printed by `cat graphify-out/.graphify_python`:\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"graphify\": {\n      \"command\": \"<absolute path from: cat graphify-out/.graphify_python>\",\n      \"args\": [\"-m\", \"graphify.serve\", \"/absolute/path/to/graphify-out/graph.json\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"}, {"id": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_step_8_token_reduction_benchmark_only_if_total_words_5000", "label": "Step 8 - Token reduction benchmark (only if total_words > 5000)", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L79", "display_label": "Heading:Step 8 - Token reduction benchmark (only if total_words > 5000)", "heading_level": 3, "text": "### Step 8 - Token reduction benchmark (only if total_words > 5000)\n\nIf `total_words` from `graphify-out/.graphify_detect.json` is greater than 5,000, run:\n\n```bash\ngraphify benchmark\n```\n\nPrint the output directly in chat. If `total_words <= 5000`, skip silently - the graph value is structural clarity, not token compression, for small corpora."}], "edges": [{"source": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_md", "target": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_graphify_reference_extra_exports_and_benchmark", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_graphify_reference_extra_exports_and_benchmark", "target": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_step_6b_wiki_only_if_wiki_flag", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_graphify_reference_extra_exports_and_benchmark", "target": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_step_7_neo4j_export_only_if_neo4j_or_neo4j_push_flag", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L15", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_graphify_reference_extra_exports_and_benchmark", "target": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_step_7a_falkordb_export_only_if_falkordb_or_falkordb_push_flag", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L31", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_graphify_reference_extra_exports_and_benchmark", "target": "$graphify-root$_tools_skillgen_expected_graphify_skills_vscode_references_exports_step_7b_svg_export_only_if_svg_flag", "relation": "contains", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "source_file": "tools/skillgen/expected/graphify__skills__vscode__references__exports.md", "source_location": "L47", "weight": 1.0}, 